<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE CLEARS INTERTECH OFFERING.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE CLEARS INTERTECH OFFERING.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange approved the public offering prospectus of electronic office equipment retailer Intertech which will transfer to the bourse's main market.</p>
<p>The company will issue 444,000 new common bearer shares at a price which will be announced at a later date.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used as working capital as well as to finance investments carried out by Intertech's subsidiaries, the bourse said. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
